 Episode previews

 Episode 1 Tummy Time

 Episode 1 Tummy Time 
 This first episode is a fantastic start to the ActiveBabiesSmartKids TV series. It begins with BabyROO’s Bit More on Tummy Time, sharing with you information on tummy time and why it’s crucially important to your baby’s brain and body development.

 This is followed by the first of our Let’s do BabyROO sessions. Here we join with you and your baby and together we do baby exercises to music, we dance to “She’ll be coming round the mountain”, introduce you to some vision games, baby massage and more. We also include some of the many fun and enjoyable ways to encourage tummy time and keep your babies happy on their fronts. You and your baby will love it! This episode concludes with an interview with paediatrician Dr Meredith Sheil, who provides specialist advice on why tummy time is so important to healthy development.

