 Episode 2 Baby Exercise

 Episode 2 Baby Exercise 
 Exercises for babies play an important part in your baby’s healthy development, even from this very young age! Your baby’s brain grows as a result of movement experiences. To help explain why and how, this episode features BabyROO’s Bit More on Baby Exercise.

 Our Let’s do BabyROO session is gorgeous and includes a hand play, baby exercises to the fun of “The ant’s go marching”, a strengthening and balance exercise, dance, rhythm, baby massage and more. We finish the episode with some terrific specialist advice on the importance of baby exercises from paediatrician and mother, Dr Meredith Sheil.

